1
00:00:00,847 --> 00:00:02,847
(Penny:)you even made out with her
on a train.

2
00:00:03,350 --> 00:00:04,590
(Sheldon:)She told you?

3
00:00:04,751 --> 00:00:06,561
(Penny:)Of course she told me,
it's the most interesting thing

4
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:08,560
(Penny:)that's ever happened to
her in her entire life!

5
00:00:09,756 --> 00:00:13,566
(Leonard:)You're too close to it,
but Amy has had a huge impact on you.

6
00:00:14,795 --> 00:00:16,135
(Leonard:)You're right.

7
00:00:16,930 --> 00:00:19,040
(Sheldon:)Without realizing it,
I've allowed that woman

8
00:00:19,199 --> 00:00:20,769
(Sheldon:)to alter my personality.

9
00:00:21,601 --> 00:00:23,141
(Leonard:)Sheldon, you didn't
have a personality,

10
00:00:23,303 --> 00:00:25,083
(Leonard:)you just had some shows you liked.

11
00:00:27,874 --> 00:00:29,044
(Penny:)No.

12
00:00:29,209 --> 00:00:30,749
(Sheldon:)No, I've changed.

13
00:00:30,911 --> 00:00:33,121
(Sheldon:)Like the frog who's put
in a pot of water

14
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:34,620
(Sheldon:)that's heated so gradually

15
00:00:34,781 --> 00:00:36,921
(Sheldon:)he doesn't realize
he's boiling to death.

16
00:00:37,050 --> 00:00:39,120
(Penny:)Or you're the frog who's
been kissed by a princess

17
00:00:39,286 --> 00:00:40,456
(Penny:)and turned into a prince.

18
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:42,930
(Leonard:)Or you're just a tall, annoying frog.

19
00:00:43,790 --> 00:00:45,270
(Sheldon:)Excuse me.

20
00:00:45,392 --> 00:00:47,172
(Sheldon:)I have to break up
with my girlfriend.

21
00:00:47,327 --> 00:00:49,667
(Penny:)-Sheldon, wait.
-No.

22
00:00:49,830 --> 00:00:52,000
(Sheldon:)You've opened my eyes to the truth.

23
00:00:52,165 --> 00:00:56,075
(Sheldon:)Amy has made me a more affectionate,
open-minded person.

24
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:01,020
(Sheldon:)And that stops now.

